#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.rst:2
msgid "GraphDisplay"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:1
msgid "Regroupe les options de rendu statistique des graphiques."
msgstr "Groups the statistical rendering options for graphs."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:3
msgid "Paramètres regroupés :"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:5
msgid "``Limits`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : limite l'affichage à l'intervalle :math:`[\\mu-3\\sigma,\\mu+3\\sigma]`."
msgstr "``Limits`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : limits the display to the :math:`[\\mu-3\\sigma,\\mu+3\\sigma]` range."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:6
msgid "``Sigma`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : affiche les repères à un, deux et trois écarts-types de la moyenne."
msgstr "``Sigma`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : displays markers at one, two, and three standard deviations from the mean."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:7
msgid "``Gauss``, ``Poiss`` et ``Exp`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : superposent respectivement les modèles gaussien, poissonnien et exponentiel."
msgstr "``Gauss``, ``Poiss``, and ``Exp`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : respectively overlay Gaussian, Poisson, and exponential models."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:9
msgid "``KDE`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : affiche l'estimation de densité par noyau."
msgstr "``KDE`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : displays the kernel density estimate."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:10
msgid "``Cumul`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : produit un histogramme cumulatif."
msgstr "``Cumul`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : produces a cumulative histogram."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:11
msgid "``Log Scale`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : utilise une échelle logarithmique."
msgstr "``Log Scale`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : uses a logarithmic scale."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:12
msgid "``Count`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : exprime l'axe Y en effectifs plutôt qu'en densité."
msgstr "``Count`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : expresses the Y-axis as counts rather than density."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:13
msgid "``Bins`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`) : nombre de classes de l'histogramme ; ``0`` active le choix automatique."
msgstr "``Bins`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`) : number of histogram bins; ``0`` enables automatic selection."

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.rst
msgid "Paramètres"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.rst:9
msgid "Attributs"
msgstr "Attributes"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay.label:1
msgid "Libellé du groupe affiché dans l'interface."
msgstr "Label of the group displayed in the interface."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay.setting_list:1
msgid "Définition des paramètres du groupe et de leur configuration."
msgstr "Definition of the group's settings and their configuration."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay.mode:1
msgid "Mode d'affichage du groupe dans l'interface."
msgstr "Default group display method."
